name: Circuit Drive - Friday Deploy
tempo: 116
# Cyber-electro. One small change. One very long weekend.
# Form in 4-bar phrases: intro 1, theme 4, answer 4,
# layered theme 4, breakdown 2, bridge 4, return 6, outro 1.
# Voices: lead, bass, harmony, answering arpeggio, kick, snare, hat.
